{"seq":3,"slug":"parameter-efficient-landscape","title":"参数高效微调方法全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/foundations/parameter-efficient-landscape","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"参数高效微调方法全景\">参数高效微调方法全景</h1><p>当全量微调因显存瓶颈被堵在消费级硬件门外时，参数高效微调（PEFT, Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning）另辟蹊径：只训练模型参数的极小子集（通常不到 1%），即可达到接近全量微调 90-95% 的效果。2026 年的 PEFT 方法已经从单一的 LoRA 发展为一个包含数十种变体的方法族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PEFT 的统一思想可以表达为：在预训练权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的基础上，通过一组参数量远小于原模型的增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 来适配下游任务，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta W| \\ll |W_0|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>adapted</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{adapted}} = W_0 + \\Delta W(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">adapted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同 PEFT 方法的核心区别在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的参数化方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    ROOT[PEFT 方法族] --&gt; ADD[加法类&lt;br/&gt;Additive]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; SEL[选择类&lt;br/&gt;Selective]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; REP[重参数化类&lt;br/&gt;Reparameterization]&#10;    ADD --&gt; A1[Adapter Layers]&#10;    ADD --&gt; A2[Soft Prompts]&#10;    ADD --&gt; A3[Side Networks]&#10;    SEL --&gt; S1[BitFit 只训练 bias]&#10;    SEL --&gt; S2[层冻结策略]&#10;    REP --&gt; R1[LoRA 低秩分解]&#10;    REP --&gt; R2[DoRA 方向+幅度分解]&#10;    REP --&gt; R3[LoRA+ 差异化学习率]\">flowchart TB\n    ROOT[PEFT 方法族] --&gt; ADD[加法类&lt;br/&gt;Additive]\n    ROOT --&gt; SEL[选择类&lt;br/&gt;Selective]\n    ROOT --&gt; REP[重参数化类&lt;br/&gt;Reparameterization]\n    ADD --&gt; A1[Adapter Layers]\n    ADD --&gt; A2[Soft Prompts]\n    ADD --&gt; A3[Side Networks]\n    SEL --&gt; S1[BitFit 只训练 bias]\n    SEL --&gt; S2[层冻结策略]\n    REP --&gt; R1[LoRA 低秩分解]\n    REP --&gt; R2[DoRA 方向+幅度分解]\n    REP --&gt; R3[LoRA+ 差异化学习率]</pre><h2 id=\"加法类方法-在网络中插入可训练模块\">加法类方法：在网络中插入可训练模块</h2><p><strong>Adapter Layers</strong>（Houlsby 2019）在 Transformer 每一层中插入小型前馈网络（bottleneck 结构）。输入先降维到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 维（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ll d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>），经过非线性激活后升回原始维度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>down</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>up</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = h + f(h W_{\\text{down}}) W_{\\text{up}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">down</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">up</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优势是训练稳定，但推理时引入额外延迟（需过额外层）。</p>\n<p><strong>Soft Prompts / Prefix Tuning</strong>（Li &amp; Liang 2021）在输入序列前添加可学习的虚拟 token embedding，不修改模型权重本身。Prefix Tuning 将可训练前缀注入每一层的 key/value 中，等价于在注意力计算中引入额外的&quot;虚拟 context&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>可训练参数量</th>\n<th>推理额外延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Adapter Layers</td>\n<td>0.5-3%</td>\n<td>有（额外前馈层）</td>\n<td>多任务共享基座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefix Tuning</td>\n<td>0.1-1%</td>\n<td>无（合并到 KV）</td>\n<td>极低资源场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt Tuning</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01%</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>NLU 分类任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IA3</td>\n<td>&lt;0.01%</td>\n<td>无（元素级乘法）</td>\n<td>few-shot 适配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重参数化类方法-lora-家族\">重参数化类方法：LoRA 家族</h2><p>LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation, Hu et al. 2021）是 2026 年事实上的标准方法。其核心假设是：微调所需的权重变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 具有低秩结构，可以分解为两个小矩阵的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = B \\times A, \\quad B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times r}, A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{r \\times k}, \\quad r \\ll \\min(d,k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当原始矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = k = 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span> 时，全量更新需要约 1600 万参数；LoRA 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 时只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4096</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>65536</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 4096 \\times 8 = 65536</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65536</span></span></span></span></span> 个参数，压缩比超过 <strong>240 倍</strong>。</p>\n<p>LoRA 的核心变体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>QLoRA</strong>（Dettmers 2023）：基座模型 4-bit 量化 + LoRA 16-bit 训练，显存再降 75%</li>\n<li><strong>DoRA</strong>（Liu et al. 2024）：将权重分解为方向（direction）和幅度（magnitude），分别适配</li>\n<li><strong>LoRA+</strong>（Hayou et al. 2024）：对 A 和 B 矩阵使用不同学习率，B 的学习率设为 A 的 4-8 倍</li>\n<li><strong>rsLoRA</strong>（Kalajdzievski 2024）：修正 scaling factor 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha / \\sqrt{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使不同 rank 的效果更一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"选择类方法-只训练部分现有参数\">选择类方法：只训练部分现有参数</h2><p>最简单的 PEFT 方式是选择模型中已有的一小部分参数进行训练：</p>\n<p><strong>BitFit</strong>（Zaken et al. 2021）只训练所有偏置项（bias），参数量不到总体的 0.1%，在中等规模任务上表现惊人地好。</p>\n<p><strong>层冻结策略</strong>：冻结底层（通用特征提取），只微调顶部 N 层。简单有效，但没有理论最优的冻结界限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方法选择的决策框架\">方法选择的决策框架</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q1{显存预算} --&gt;|&gt;=24 GB| Q2{任务复杂度}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&lt;16 GB| Q3[QLoRA rank 8-16]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|高: 推理/代码| Q4[LoRA rank 32-64&lt;br/&gt;全模块适配]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|中: 格式/风格| Q5[LoRA rank 8-16&lt;br/&gt;qv_proj]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|低: 分类| Q6[Prompt Tuning&lt;br/&gt;或 IA3]\">flowchart TD\n    Q1{显存预算} --&gt;|&gt;=24 GB| Q2{任务复杂度}\n    Q1 --&gt;|&lt;16 GB| Q3[QLoRA rank 8-16]\n    Q2 --&gt;|高: 推理/代码| Q4[LoRA rank 32-64&lt;br/&gt;全模块适配]\n    Q2 --&gt;|中: 格式/风格| Q5[LoRA rank 8-16&lt;br/&gt;qv_proj]\n    Q2 --&gt;|低: 分类| Q6[Prompt Tuning&lt;br/&gt;或 IA3]</pre><p>2026 年的实践共识是：<strong>LoRA/QLoRA 是默认选择</strong>。只有在显存极度受限（&lt;4 GB）或任务极简（二分类）时才考虑 Prompt Tuning 等更轻量的方法。Adapter 方法因推理延迟和 LoRA 的性能优势而逐渐退出主流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PEFT 方法族分为加法类（插入模块）、选择类（训练子集）、重参数化类（低秩分解）</li>\n<li>LoRA 通过低秩矩阵分解将可训练参数压缩 100-1000 倍，是 2026 年的事实标准</li>\n<li>QLoRA 在 LoRA 基础上加入 4-bit 量化，使 7B 模型训练只需 6-10 GB 显存</li>\n<li>方法选择主要由显存预算和任务复杂度决定，LoRA/QLoRA 覆盖 90% 以上的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../methods/lora-qlora\">LoRA 与 QLoRA 低秩适配</a>——深入 LoRA 的数学细节、超参数选择与实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../ai-llm/data-centric-ai/synthetic/synthetic-data\">Data-Centric AI 中的合成数据</a>——从数据视角理解如何为微调准备高质量训练集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"参数高效微调方法全景","id":"参数高效微调方法全景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加法类方法：在网络中插入可训练模块","id":"加法类方法-在网络中插入可训练模块"},{"level":2,"text":"重参数化类方法：LoRA 家族","id":"重参数化类方法-lora-家族"},{"level":2,"text":"选择类方法：只训练部分现有参数","id":"选择类方法-只训练部分现有参数"},{"level":2,"text":"方法选择的决策框架","id":"方法选择的决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"全量微调的内存与计算瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/foundations/full-fine-tuning-mechanics"},"next":{"title":"LoRA 与 QLoRA 低秩适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/lora-qlora"}}